{"pin":"AB00215","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00215","anchor":"","first_line":"I call upon Thee, O my God, with my heart and my tongue, my spirit and my innermost being, and I commune with Thee in the depths of this darkness that hath descended [3.5s]... ...O ye My faithful loved ones!  Should at any time afflicting events come to pass in the Holy Land, never feel disturbed or agitated","first_line_orig":"ادعوک یا الهی بقلبی و لسانی و روحی و جنانی و اناجیک فی بهره ظلام سابل الاذیال  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"790","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AMK.003-008","source":"AMK","locator":"003-008"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK4.446x","source":"AVK4","locator":"446x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK4/ak4-450.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AYT.524x","source":"AYT","locator":"524x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AT/at-524.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"DWNP_v3#03-4 p.023-024x","source":"DWNP_v3","locator":"03-4 p.023-024x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/the-dawn-vol-3-burma-1925"},{"kind":"publication","code":"HYB.153x","source":"HYB","locator":"153x"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS5.145bx","source":"MAS5","locator":"145bx","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MAS5/mas5-145.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"GPB.309x","source":"GPB","locator":"309x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/366481740"},{"kind":"translation","code":"PAB.025x","source":"PAB","locator":"025x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/shoghieffendi_blomfield_passing_abdulbaha"}]},{"code":"AB00215AFF","anchor":"aff","translations":[{"language":"fo","lang_name":"Faroese"}]}]}
